<title>USA: Kilroy Realty sets first dividend.</title>
<headline>Kilroy Realty sets first dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kilroy Realty Corp said Monday its board of directors have approved the company's first dividend.</p>
<p>The cash dividend of $0.2583 a share will be payable on May 30, 1997 to shareholders of record on May 22, 1997. Kilroy became a publicly traded real estate investment trust on January 31, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the dividend is equivalent to an annual rate of $1.55 a share, the amount anticipated during the company's initial public offering.</p>
</text>
